## Wholesale price env vars (platform-injected — do NOT commit)

Injected at build from `/opt/generate-app/.env`. Update prices there when providers change rates.

| Variable | Default (USD / 1M tokens) | Provider / model |
|----------|----------------------------|------------------|
| `CREDITS_CHARGE_MULTIPLIER` | `2` | Markup on all metered usage (2× wholesale) |
| `DEEPINFRA_CHAT_INPUT_PRICE_PER_M` | `0.15` | DeepInfra fast chat — `openai/gpt-oss-120b-Turbo` input (`DEEPINFRA_CHAT_MODEL`) |
| `DEEPINFRA_CHAT_OUTPUT_PRICE_PER_M` | `0.60` | DeepInfra fast chat — `openai/gpt-oss-120b-Turbo` output |
| `DEEPINFRA_INFERENCE_INPUT_PRICE_PER_M` | `0.08` | DeepInfra chat — `Qwen/Qwen3-32B` (see deepinfra.com/pricing) |
| `DEEPINFRA_INFERENCE_OUTPUT_PRICE_PER_M` | `0.28` | DeepInfra chat — `Qwen/Qwen3-32B` |
| `DEEPINFRA_EMBEDDING_PRICE_PER_M` | `0.01` | Embeddings — `Qwen/Qwen3-Embedding-0.6B` |
| `DEEPINFRA_RERANKER_PRICE_PER_M` | `0.01` | Rerank — `Qwen/Qwen3-Reranker-0.6B` (when billed) |

**App build inject** (`/opt/generate-app/.env` on server2). **ZAPI speech/TTS** uses separate vars on server1 — see table below.

**DeepInfra rates are model-specific.** When `DEEPINFRA_INFERENCE_MODEL` (or embedding/reranker model) changes on the build server, update the matching `*_PRICE_PER_M` vars to match [deepinfra.com/pricing](https://deepinfra.com/pricing). Do not reuse Llama 3.1 8B rates for Qwen3-32B.

### ZAPI speech / TTS prices (server1 — `/opt/zeresoft/.env`)

Screen Recorder transcribe and re-voice run in ZAPI, not in child apps. Update when `AI_SPEECH_MODEL` or `AI_TTS_MODEL` changes.

| Variable | Default (USD) | Model / unit |
|----------|---------------|--------------|
| `CREDITS_CHARGE_MULTIPLIER` | `2` | Same markup as apps |
| `AI_SPEECH_MODEL` | `mistralai/Voxtral-Mini-3B-2507` | STT model id |
| `AI_SPEECH_USD_PER_MINUTE` | `0.00100` | Voxtral — per audio minute (estimate fallback) |
| `AI_TTS_MODEL` | `canopylabs/orpheus-3b-0.1-ft` | TTS model id |
| `AI_TTS_USD_PER_MILLION_CHARS` | `7.0` | Orpheus — per 1M characters (estimate fallback) |

ZAPI: `screen_recording_billing.py` → `MeteredChargeService.charge_space_owner` (not JWT user `credits/charge`).

Groq and Cerebras are retired (2026-10-17): no `GROQ_*` / `CEREBRAS_*` price vars are injected. `meta-llama/Meta-Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct-Turbo` (replaces Groq `llama-3.1-8b-instant`) is $0.02 / $0.04 per M — put those rates in app code if you use it.

